---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Brand Memory Vault · Rivett Field Kit"
  description="A premium Rivett field kit for turning brand voice, proof, objections, and customer language into agent-readable memory."
  currentNav="field-kits"
>
  <main class="kit-detail">
    <section class="kit-hero">
      <div class="page detail-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="stamp">Field Kit 01 · Brand Memory</div>
          <h1>Your brand voice is trapped <span class="ital">in your head.</span></h1>
          <p class="lede">A five-file vault for turning customer language, proof, objections, offer boundaries, and founder taste into memory your agents can use before they write.</p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn primary" href="/field-kits/brand-memory-vault.pdf" download>Download PDF →</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="/blog/brand-voice-trapped-in-head">Read the note</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="/diagnostic">Book diagnostic</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="vault-visual" aria-label="Brand Memory Vault file stack">
          <div class="vault-top">brand-memory-vault</div>
          <div class="file f1"><span>01</span><b>audience.md</b><em>Who this is for</em></div>
          <div class="file f2"><span>02</span><b>offer.md</b><em>What you sell</em></div>
          <div class="file f3"><span>03</span><b>proof.md</b><em>What you can defend</em></div>
          <div class="file f4"><span>04</span><b>voice.md</b><em>What sounds right</em></div>
          <div class="file f5"><span>05</span><b>objections.md</b><em>What blocks the deal</em></div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page split-section">
      <div class="side-label">The problem</div>
      <div>
        <h2>Generic output is usually a memory problem.</h2>
        <p>You ask for a landing page. The model gives you something clean and dead. Then the founder rewrites it by instinct.</p>
        <p>That instinct is the missing system. This vault turns it into source material an agent can read.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page file-matrix">
      <div class="matrix-head">
        <span class="label">The five files</span>
        <h2>Enough structure to be useful. Not enough to become theater.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="matrix">
        <div><b>audience.md</b><span>Buyer, beliefs, language, wrong-fit customers.</span></div>
        <div><b>offer.md</b><span>What you sell, what it replaces, where not to overclaim.</span></div>
        <div><b>proof.md</b><span>Numbers, stories, failures, source links.</span></div>
        <div><b>voice.md</b><span>Good examples, bad examples, words to use, words to avoid.</span></div>
        <div><b>objections.md</b><span>What buyers say, what they mean, what answer works.</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="workflow-band">
      <div class="page workflow-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="label">Weekly ritual</span>
          <h2>Fifteen minutes. Five additions. The vault compounds.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="ritual">
          <div><span>01</span><b>Add one approved line.</b></div>
          <div><span>02</span><b>Add one rejected phrase and why it failed.</b></div>
          <div><span>03</span><b>Add one customer phrase.</b></div>
          <div><span>04</span><b>Add one proof point.</b></div>
          <div><span>05</span><b>Add one objection from the week.</b></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page prompt-section">
      <div class="prompt-card">
        <span class="label">Agent prompt</span>
        <pre><code>Read the brand-memory-vault folder before drafting.

Use audience.md to decide who this is for.
Use offer.md to avoid vague positioning.
Use proof.md for specific evidence.
Use voice.md for tone and banned patterns.
Use objections.md to handle resistance honestly.

Before writing, summarize:
1. The buyer.
2. The belief we are challenging.
3. The proof we can use.
4. The claim we must avoid.</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="quality-list">
        <span class="label">Ship check</span>
        <h2>Ask this before anything goes live.</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Did this use real proof?</li>
          <li>Did this answer a real objection?</li>
          <li>Could a competitor say the same thing?</li>
          <li>Did the agent invent a claim?</li>
          <li>Would the founder still need to rewrite the whole thing?</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  .kit-detail .stamp,.kit-detail .label,.kit-detail .side-label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent-deep)}
  .kit-detail .stamp::before,.kit-detail .label::before,.kit-detail .side-label::before{content:'';display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);margin-right:12px;transform:translateY(-1px)}
  .kit-hero{padding:76px 0 68px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
  .detail-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 420px;gap:72px;align-items:center}
  .kit-hero h1{font-size:clamp(54px,7vw,104px);line-height:0.92;letter-spacing:-0.055em;margin:28px 0 0;max-width:920px;text-wrap:balance}
  .kit-hero .ital{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-dim);letter-spacing:-0.02em}
  .kit-hero .lede{font-size:22px;line-height:1.48;color:var(--ink-dim);max-width:680px;margin:34px 0 0}
  .kit-detail .actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:34px}
  .kit-detail .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:46px;padding:13px 18px;border:1px solid var(--ink);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .kit-detail .btn.primary{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
  .kit-detail .btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink)}
  .vault-visual{background:var(--paper-2);border:1px solid var(--ink);padding:24px;position:relative}
  .vault-top{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-faint);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong);padding-bottom:16px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .vault-visual .file{display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px 1fr;gap:10px 16px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .vault-visual .file:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .vault-visual .file span{grid-row:1/3;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:var(--accent-deep);padding-top:4px}
  .vault-visual .file b{font-size:24px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.035em}
  .vault-visual .file em{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;color:var(--ink-dim)}
  .split-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:240px 1fr;gap:64px;padding-top:72px;padding-bottom:72px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
  .split-section h2,.matrix-head h2,.workflow-band h2,.quality-list h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,54px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-0.045em;margin:0;max-width:760px;text-wrap:balance}
  .split-section p{font-size:21px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink-dim);max-width:720px;margin:22px 0 0}
  .file-matrix{padding-top:76px;padding-bottom:84px}
  .matrix-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:240px 1fr;gap:64px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:32px}
  .matrix{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);border-top:2px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
  .matrix div{padding:24px 18px 28px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);min-height:190px}
  .matrix div:last-child{border-right:0}
  .matrix b{display:block;font-size:23px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.03em}
  .matrix span{display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink-dim);margin-top:14px}
  .workflow-band{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);padding:76px 0}
  .workflow-band .label{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72)}
  .workflow-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr;gap:64px}
  .workflow-band h2{margin-top:20px;color:var(--paper)}
  .ritual{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.28)}
  .ritual div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px 1fr;gap:22px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18)}
  .ritual span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.22em;color:var(--accent)}
  .ritual b{font-size:22px;line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
  .prompt-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:48px;padding-top:84px;padding-bottom:96px}
  .prompt-card{background:var(--paper-2);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);padding:28px}
  .prompt-card pre{white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink);margin:18px 0 0}
  .quality-list ul{margin:28px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;border-top:2px solid var(--ink)}
  .quality-list li{padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
  @media (max-width:980px){
    .detail-grid,.split-section,.matrix-head,.workflow-grid,.prompt-section{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px}
    .matrix{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .matrix div{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);min-height:auto}
  }
  @media print{
    .site-header,.mobile-menu,.actions{display:none !important}
    .kit-hero{padding-top:28px}
    .kit-hero,.split-section,.file-matrix,.workflow-band,.prompt-section{break-inside:avoid}
    .detail-grid,.split-section,.matrix-head,.workflow-grid,.prompt-section{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}
    .matrix{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .matrix div{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);min-height:auto}
    .workflow-band{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);border-top:2px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong)}
    .workflow-band h2{color:var(--ink)}
    .workflow-band .label{color:var(--accent-deep)}
    .ritual div{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
    .ritual b{color:var(--ink)}
  }
</style>
